codex
The root cause is environmental: this container exposes `/proc/self/exe` but not `/proc/<namespace-pid>/exe`, while Lean 4.22 calls the latter to locate itself. I’ll use a temporary preload shim that redirects only that executable-path lookup to `/proc/self/exe`; this changes neither the proof nor the pinned project/toolchain.
apply patch
